entry-3974113940.md)\\n\\n# WS-04: Release Process\\n\\n**Status**: in_progress\\n\\n**Priority**: P1\\n\\n**Owner**: Tyler Yahn (SIG lead context); actions on Alex Boten / Nico Hertz\\n\\n**Project**: opentelemetry-go\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2025-11-27\\n\\n## Decisions and Superseded Directions\\n\\n- **OTelConf RC (`T001`)**: On 2025-11-20, merge the OTelConf RC support PR as-is (pending normal review); track experimental API structure review under `1.40.0` `(SRC-NOTE-07)`.\\n\\n- **Runtime profiling API (`T002`)**: On 2025-11-27, do not merge the large public-API change without prior issue discussion; keep the existing PR as draft/proof of concept; begin with a smaller disablement change `(SRC-NOTE-08)`.\\n\\n# WS-04: Release Process\\n\\n**Status**: in_progress\\n\\n**Priority**: P1\\n\\n**Owner**: Tyler Yahn (SIG lead context); actions on Alex Boten / Nico Hertz\\n\\n**Project**: opentelemetry-go\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2025-11-27\\n\\n## Sources\\n\\n- `SRC-NOTE-07` — [entry-3581463689.md](../opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3581463689.md)\\n\\n- `SRC-NOTE-08` — [entry-3974113940.md](../opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3974113940.md)\\n\\n# WS-04: Release Process\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"blocker and depend t001 a of 2025 11 20 the releas wa describ a block on rc support modul review src note 07 final merg deliveri of that pr is not in the packag w 04 releas process status in _ progress prioriti p1 owner tyler yahn sig lead context action on alex boten nico hertz project opentelemetri go last updat 2025 11 27 sourc src note 07 entri 3581463689 md opentelemetri meet note entri 3581463689 md src note 08 entri 3974113940 md opentelemetri meet note entri 3974113940 md w 04 releas process status in _ progress prioriti p1 owner tyler yahn sig lead context action on alex boten nico hertz project opentelemetri go last updat 2025 11 27 decis and supersed direct otelconf rc t001 on 2025 11 20 merg the otelconf rc support pr ais pend normal review track experiment api structur review under 140 0 src note 07 runtim profil api t002 on 2025 11 27 do not merg the larg public api chang without prior issu discuss keep the exist pr a draft proof of concept begin with a smaller disabl chang src note 08 w 04 releas process status in _ progress prioriti p1 owner tyler yahn sig lead context action on alex boten nico hertz project opentelemetri go last updat 2025 11 27 sourc src note 07 entri 3581463689 md opentelemetri meet note entri 3581463689 md src note 08 entri 3974113940 md opentelemetri meet note entri 3974113940 md w 04 releas process\", \"dataset_id\": \"b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"cfa03fe68a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"work-states/WS-04-release-process.md\", \"id\": \"6ed60c677b370ee3\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2948305515791658, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.09643015939880836, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7577648, \"dataset_name\": \"С2WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"work-states/WS-04-release-process.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"cfa03fe68a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"work-states/WS-04-release-process.md\", \"location\": \"work-states/WS-04-release-process.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 2507, \"chunk_count\": 4, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:48:43\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:11:34\", \"token_count\": 2081, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"work-state\"}}}, {\"content\": \"- Two non-observability items noted:\\n\\n  - Sync map / atomics for fixed bucket histograms.\\n\\n  - Exemplar reservoir changes.\\n\\n- Safe to slip to next release; include if ready.\\n\\n### 4. Stabilizing new attribute value types\\n\\n- Discussion about stabilizing new spec attribute types (byte arrays, “any” type).\\n\\n- Prototype implementation exists and needs review.\\n\\n- Considered tricky; careful review needed around limits and types.\\n\\n### 5. Processor `Enabled` method\\n\\n- Proposal from Robert to move `Enabled` from filter processor to main processor interface.\\n\\n- Spec now stabilized and allows this.\\n\\n- Pros: consistent API, less ad-hoc type assertion/boilerplate in docs.\\n\\n- Con: processors that are “always enabled” need a trivial `Enabled() bool { return true }`.\\n\\n- General agreement; will revisit for final confirmation.\\n\\n### 6. OTLP `insecure` support (logs, env vars, spec)\\n\\n- PR adds `insecure` (env var) support for OTLP **logs**, matching traces/metrics.\\n\\n- HTTP OTLP config historically messy; env vars common in practice.\\n\\n- Spec unclear due to moratorium on env vars.\\n\\n- Direction: add logs support in Go; push for spec clarity later.\\n\\n### 7. Collector protobuf changes & PDataGen\\n\\n- Collector removed dependency on Go protobuf types; now uses `pdataGen`.\\n\\n- Large internal rewrite; significant line count reduction.\\n\\n- Benchmarks improved (fewer allocations).\\n\\n- Some cross-language quirks surfaced but manageable.\\n\\n- Go SIG interested in exploring similar approaches; needs more benchmarking.\\n\\n### 8. KubeCon & talks\\n\\n- First SIG meeting since KubeCon.\\n\\n- Members encouraged to share notable talks and videos once available.\\n\\n**Source ID**: [SRC-NOTE-07]\\n\\n# Meeting Note: OpenTelemetry Go SIG — 2025-11-26\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/issues/6648#issuecomment-3581463689  \\n\\n**Author**: pellared  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-11-26T14:02:28Z · **Updated**: 2025-11-26T16:36:01Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Date:** 2025-11-20  \\n\\n## Decisions\\n\\n- Merge OTelConf RC support PR as-is (pending normal review).\\n\\n- Track experimental API structure review (e.g., `x` submodule) under the `1.40.0` milestone.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"two non observ item note sync map atom for fi